      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can sense the frustration and helplessness you're feeling. Losing paperwork can be a frustrating experience, especially when it seems like a repetitive pattern is occurring. It's understandable that you feel like a glitch in the system, but try not to give up - keep documenting every interaction and attempt to appeal the decision to create a paper trail. This might help demonstrate your efforts to the housing office and potentially lead to a re-examination of your case.",
