      "content": "It can be incredibly disheartening to feel like your efforts are falling on deaf ears and that you're being ignored. The feeling of being erased from the system is a bleak one, and it's natural to question the value of continuing to fight. However, memories, emails, and records of your interactions can serve as a testament to your existence and persistence, even if the system doesn't acknowledge it.",
